From 5b336f43ea9f4249ddf480797eec334f77dc54b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 09:14:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tu: Fix GMEM clears with an FDM offset on the blit-event
 clear path

Unlike the a7xx generic clear path, GMEM was left uncleared for a6xx
devices with per-view viewports.

Fixes: 9e632244246 ("tu: Use a patchpoint for subpass clears with FDM")
Signed-off-by: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43953>

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/5b336f43ea9f4249ddf480797eec334f77dc54b2]

---
 src/freedreno/ci/freedreno-a660-fails.txt | 37 -----------------------
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_clear_blit.cc     |  9 +++---
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)

